Priority

I would place it after the Journal Entry workflow is functional, but before we deeply polish the main page layout.

That means our current order stays:

Finish Growing Place creation and selection inside the Journal Entry.
Finish Plant selection.
Fix photo attachment.
Build the saved Journal Entry page.
Add edit and delete.
Then rebuild the app shell around the satchel navigation.

That keeps us from decorating scaffolding we already know will be dismantled. The satchel can wait on its hook for a little while longer. 🌿